                      </div>
                      <p class="glue-headline glue-headline--headline-5">A2UI 1.0: Build delightful, fast, reliable, agentic experiences</p>
                      <div class="glue-card__cta-custom glue-spacer-3-top">
                        <span class="glue-cta">NOV. 11, 2026</span>
